WEBVTT

00:00:02.756 --> 00:00:06.553
Welcome to Nam Illam. Choose Create a new home if you are starting

00:00:06.553 --> 00:00:10.607
fresh. If your family invited you, join that existing home instead

00:00:10.607 --> 00:00:12.313
of creating a duplicate.

00:00:12.313 --> 00:00:15.000
Enter a home name such as Our Home.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.243
This is a label inside the app, not your street address or a

00:00:18.243 --> 00:00:21.741
login account. Then choose Create my home.

00:00:21.741 --> 00:00:23.661
Your new home starts empty.

00:00:23.661 --> 00:00:27.032
Open Pantry to record what you have, Shopping for what you need,

00:00:27.032 --> 00:00:29.390
or Expenses to record a purchase.

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:31.310
The setup activities are optional.

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:33.870
Use Today for your schedule and reminders.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:36.515
Your household works locally without an app account.

00:00:36.515 --> 00:00:40.064
Family sharing and iCloud are optional, and can be set up later.
